Path: `scripts/render_table.py`

Examples:

```bash
# CSV with header row
python3 scripts/render_table.py --csv data.csv

# CSV without header row
python3 scripts/render_table.py --csv data.csv --no-header --headers "Protocol,#Replicas,View-progress"

# JSON list of objects
python3 scripts/render_table.py --json data.json

# Delimited stdin
printf "a,b,c\n1,2,3\n" | python3 scripts/render_table.py --stdin --delimiter ','
```

