   460	release count, the source~$\Cfg$, and a head.
   461	
   462	\paragraph{Finality reconciliation.}  On each $F$ advance, the active
   463	view shrinks to the blocks compatible with the new~$F$; $\Sigma.\T$
   464	stays cumulative.  Delete incompatible leases and
   465	their targets from all $\fastWrite$ sets, and empty incompatible saved
   466	genuine results without clearing their evaluated slots.  Set $S:=F$
   467	when $F\not\preceq S$.  Keep signed vote and row pools, vote and block
   468	stamps, the validator record~$\Lambda$, and~$\hmax$.
   469	A compatible lease below~$F$ can remain until its usual expiry or
   470	release; it cannot veto a descendant of~$F$.  Never move a conflicting
   471	lease to a new target or replace a saved result by~$F$.  The assignment
